 8. 🍁 1 for the road: Peak fall 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: Explore Fall . Graphic: Jim Sergent Fall color is expected across most of the country by mid-October, Axios' Jim Sergent writes. 

 But weather could scramble the timetable: A strong El Niño could raise temperatures and delay some peak colors, according to the National Weather Service. Share this map . 

 
 
